 𝟮𝗵𝟭𝟬\n\nUnited Kingdom\, United States of America\n(English)\n
 \n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : Andrew Patterson\n𝗦
